HVWUGNJc0VNM1BHSlZscU5ab3pIcU1LMVhTMTZrdHQzUDY5R3VrSTlEQVpwWTc1V3FKQUgyUGhiUXlyRzdCY2lhdTYyNlJGZXZLVnpuVGR3NDJ0b1hsdlhPTVRUdjdoX05WVUJyMHEyeXZ2Zw?oc=5","date":"2026-10-27","zh":"儘管獲利強勁並上調了 2026 年指引，但由於股價遭到拋售，Welltower 股價暴跌超過 5%"},{"title":"Welltower's Q3 income trails consensus; 2026 guidance raised on SHOP, investments","src":"TradingView","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","date":"2026-10-26","zh":"Welltower 第三季營收低於預期；就商店、投資提出 2026 年指引"},{"title":"Welltower falls on Q3 earnings miss despite raising guidance","src":"Investing.com","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirAFBVV95cUxNUEpFQU95X3pyNzhmQm93YlZ3WUtzTklIN3ZRYUdBeW5qOTZ1andMb2hPQlZhZVN0QWx4OWhuTzE0V1YwSnE4TFhXbnpYRmVLOFlENGhzRmxORE5nMWtmOEx1Z2RwUnk4NW1yQldKX0kwZXREbFZwdlVJUFBIT3o2NnV1MDVmWWVOdWNKaHJwU2g3LTZUdEtaYUVsWkplWmlWVXBYZ3JtejBGOTFv?oc=5","date":"2026-10-26","zh":"儘管提高了指引，Welltower 第三季獲利仍低於預期"}],"themes":[{"name":"財報","count":7},{"name":"AI 人工智慧","count":1},{"name":"能源/電力","count":1},{"name":"減重藥/生技","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-02-12","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/766704/000076670426000010/well-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"Through our disciplined approach to capital allocation powered by our Data Science platform and superior operating results driven by the Welltower Business System - our end-to-end platform - we aspire to deliver long-term compounding of per share growth for our existing investors. To meet these objectives, we predominantly invest across seniors housing, wellness housing and post-acute care communities and diversify our investment portfolio by property type, relationship and geographic location.","zh":"透過由我們的數據科學平台提供支援的嚴格資本配置方法以及由 Welltower 業務系統（我們的端到端平台）驅動的卓越營運業績，我們渴望為現有投資者提供長期的每股複合成長。為了實現這些目標，我們主要投資於老年人住房、健康住房和急診社區，並根據房產類型、關係和地理位置實現投資組合多元化。"},{"en":"Welltower Inc. is the initial member and majority owner of Welltower OP, with an approximate ownership interest of 98.378% as of December 31, 2025. Welltower Inc. issues equity from time to time, the net proceeds of which it is obligated to contribute as additional capital to Welltower OP. All debt including credit facilities, senior notes and secured debt is incurred by Welltower OP or its subsidiaries and Welltower Inc. has fully and unconditionally guaranteed all existing and future senior unsecured notes.","zh":"Welltower Inc. 是 Welltower OP 的初始成员和多数股东，截至 2025 年 12 月 31 日，其所有权权益约为 98.378%。 Welltower Inc. 不时发行股权，其净收益有义务作为额外资本注入 Welltower OP。所有債務（包括信貸額度、優先票據和有擔保債務）均由 Welltower OP 或其子公司承擔，並且 Welltower Inc. 已完全無條件地為所有現有和未來的高級無擔保票據提供擔保。"},{"en":"Unless stated otherwise or the context otherwise requires, references to \"Welltower\" mean Welltower Inc. and references to \"Welltower OP\" mean Welltower OP LLC. References to \"we,\" \"us,\" \"our\" or the \"Company\" mean collectively Welltower, Welltower OP and those entities/subsidiaries wholly-owned or controlled by Welltower and/or Welltower OP.","zh":"除非另有說明或上下文另有要求，否則提及的「Welltower」是指 Welltower Inc.，提及的「Welltower OP」是指 Welltower OP LLC。提及的「我們」、「我們的」或「公司」統指 Welltower、Welltower OP 以及由 Welltower 和/或 Welltower OP 全資擁有或控制的實體/子公司。"}],"markets":[],"customers":[{"en":"Any net income from prohibited transactions (which are, in general, sales or other dispositions of property held primarily for sale to customers in the ordinary course of business, other than dispositions of foreclosure property) will be subject to a 100% tax","zh":"來自禁止交易的任何淨收入（通常是在正常業務過程中出售或以其他方式處置主要用於出售給客戶的財產，而不是取消抵押品贖回權的財產的處置）將繳納 100% 的稅"}],"competition":[{"en":"We compete with other real estate investment trusts, real estate partnerships, private equity and hedge fund investors, banks, insurance companies, finance/investment companies, government-sponsored agencies, taxable and tax-exempt bond funds, healthcare operators, developers and other investors in the acquisition, development, leasing and financing of healthcare and seniors housing properties. We compete for investments based on a number of factors including relationships, certainty of execution, investment structures and underwriting criteria. Our ability to successfully compete is impacted by economic and demographic trends, availability of acceptable investment opportunities, our ability to negotiate beneficial investment terms, availability and cost of capital, construction and renovation costs and applicable laws and regulations.","zh":"我們與其他房地產投資信託、房地產合夥、私募股權和對沖基金投資者、銀行、保險公司、金融/投資公司、政府資助機構、應稅和免稅債券基金、醫療保健運營商、開發商和其他投資者在醫療保健和老年人住房的收購、開發、租賃和融資方面展開競爭。我们根据多种因素来竞争投资，包括关系、执行的确定性、投资结构和承保标准。我們成功競爭的能力受到經濟和人口趨勢、可接受的投資機會的可用性、我們談判有利投資條款的能力、資本的可用性和成本、建設和改造成本以及適用的法律和法規的影響。"},{"en":"The operators/tenants of our properties compete with properties that provide comparable services in the local markets. Operators/tenants compete for patients and residents based on a number of factors including quality of care, reputation, physical appearance of properties, location, services offered, family preferences (including a preference for home health services instead of residing in one of our communities), physicians, staff and price. We also face competition from other healthcare facilities for tenants, such as physicians and other healthcare providers that provide comparable facilities and services.","zh":"我们物业的运营商/租户与在当地市场提供类似服务的物业竞争。營運商/租戶根據多種因素爭奪患者和居民，包括護理品質、聲譽、物業外觀、位置、提供的服務、家庭偏好（包括偏好家庭健康服務而不是居住在我們的社區之一）、醫生、員工和價格。我们还面临来自其他医疗保健机构对租户的竞争，例如提供类似设施和服务的医生和其他医疗保健提供者。"}],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Senior Housing Operating","val":8489095000,"zh":"老年住房運營"},{"name":"Triple Net","val":1197042000,"zh":"三網"},{"name":"Outpatient Medical","val":781932000,"zh":"門診醫療"}],"total":10838034000},"geo":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"US","val":7936873000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"GB","val":2166820000,"zh":"英國"},{"name":"CA","val":734341000,"zh":"加拿大"}],"total":10838034000}},"peers":["VTR","PLD","PSA","DLR","VMRK"]}}